invariant: INV-13
file: srv_out.c
catches: quic_loop_test
reason: CRYPTO bytes the QUIC server's on_crypto_out refused keep the
  handler's last alert, which names a peer fault, where RFC 9846 section
  6.2 names internal_error for this side's own failure. bin/quic_loop_test
  refuses the NewSessionTicket's 1-RTT bytes and requires internal_error
  and 0x0150.

--- old
    if (cfg->srv.on_crypto_out(cfg->io, h->level, p, n) != 0) {
        h->alert = ALERT_INTERNAL_ERROR;
        return CH_EIO;
    }
--- new
    if (cfg->srv.on_crypto_out(cfg->io, h->level, p, n) != 0) {
        return CH_EIO;
    }
